@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Business Domain Model - REVIEW (not ERD / JPA)
hide methods
class Customer {
 fullName
 dateOfBirth
 optionalProfile
}
class VerifiedIdentityDocument {
 documentType
 documentNumber
 externalVerificationEvidence
}
class Subscriber {
 phoneNumber
 activatedAt
}
class PhoneNumberInventory
class PhoneNumber {
 e164Number
 availability
}
class ActivationRequest {
 callerApplication
 requestReference
 allocationMode
 waitConsent
 status
 waitingSince
 waitingDeadline
 outcome
}
class ServicePackage {
 name
 saleStatus
 currentPriceVND
 durationCalendarDays
 grandfatherPolicy
}
class PackageSubscription {
 lifecycleState
 version
 autoRenew
 coverageEnd
 cancellationEffectiveAt
}
class SubscriptionCycle {
 start
 end
 paidPriceVND
 durationDaysSnapshot
 catalogVersionSnapshot
}
class CancellationIntent {
 requestedAt
 receiptCheckedAtAfterConfirmedCommit
 acceptedAt
 outcome
}
class Account {
 accountKind
 balanceVND
 allowedDirections
 optionalExpiry
 lifecycleState
}
class Transaction {
 direction
 sourceType
 amountVND
 balanceBefore
 balanceAfter
 recordedAt
 eligibilityCheckedAt
}
class OperationRequest {
 callerApplication
 operationKind
 requestReference
 businessContent
 status
 outcome
}
class DailyReportPeriod {
 localDate
 frozenSourceSet
 status
}
class ReportContribution {
 contributionKind
 originalLocalDate
 amountVND
}
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Subscriber : owns
Customer "1" -- "1..*" VerifiedIdentityDocument : verified links
PhoneNumberInventory "1" o-- "0..*" PhoneNumber
PhoneNumber "1" -- "0..1" Subscriber : current assignment
Subscriber "1" -- "1..*" Account
Subscriber "1" -- "0..*" PackageSubscription
ServicePackage "1" -- "0..*" PackageSubscription
PackageSubscription "1" *-- "0..*" SubscriptionCycle : prepaid cycles
PackageSubscription "1" -- "0..*" CancellationIntent
Account "1" -- "0..*" Transaction
SubscriptionCycle "0..1" -- "0..*" Transaction : consumption attribution
SubscriptionCycle "0..1" -- "1" Transaction : successful cycle fee
OperationRequest "1" -- "0..1" Transaction : manual monetary effect
OperationRequest "0..1" -- "0..1" CancellationIntent : cancellation
ActivationRequest "1" --> "0..1" Subscriber : successful outcome
ActivationRequest "0..*" --> "0..1" Customer : resolved customer
DailyReportPeriod "1" -- "0..*" ReportContribution : posted in period
Transaction "1" -- "0..1" ReportContribution : one BASE or ADJUSTMENT
note bottom of SubscriptionCycle
 [start,end), local calendar days; immutable paid terms.
 Root coverageEnd = end of ALL paid cycles.
 Root may have zero cycles only while no successful purchase exists.
 Cancellation preserves paid cycles, no refund.
end note
note right of Transaction
 recordedAt is DB business time inside ultimately committed tx.
 Not physical commit completion time.
 Credit has no package consumption attribution.
 Fee links one cycle; consumption links one effective cycle.
end note
note bottom of OperationRequest
 Caller + operation + request reference: at most one effect.
 Full replay: monetary30days; cancellation7days; then tombstone.
 No database keys/indexes/lock classes in this business model.
end note
note left of ActivationRequest
 Hybrid: sync success/failure.
 WAITING only automatic empty pool + consent, max24h.
 Success => one Subscriber + MAIN balance0.
 Recovery60s; not package-renewal cadence.
end note
@enduml
